          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Isaka wayeneminyaka engamashumi amane mhla emthatha uRebeka indodakazi kaBetuweli umAramu wasePhadani Aramu, udadewabo kaLabani umAramu, abe ngumkakhe.",
          "type": "text",
