          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasemuva kwaphuma umfowabo, isandla sakhe sabamba isithende sika-Esawu; igama lakhe lalinguJakobe, u-Isaka wayeneminyaka engamashumi ayisithupha ekuzalweni kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
