              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Esawu wayesethi kuJakobe: “Ake ngizwe lokho okunathwayo okubomvu; Ngalokho igama lakhe lathiwa u-Edomi.",
          "type": "text",
